OL,3,GNEWSANo timeline set for fixing hole
OL,4,Aunder tram route
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is no timeline for when a
OL,7,Fsuspended Sheffield tram route will be
OL,8,Fable to be reopened, authorities have
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FThe blue Supertram route between
OL,12,FGleadless Townend and Halfway was
OL,13,Fsuspended in September after a
OL,14,FVictorian well and mineshaft were found
OL,15,Fbeneath the tracks on Birley Lane.
OL,17,FSurveys, technical studies and borehole
OL,18,Fdrilling have been carried out, and
OL,19,Finvestigations are continuing into
OL,20,Fgroundwater conditions and any historic
OL,21,Fmine workings beneath the site.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
